{"id":"6f2ff6d2212fecee","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Chaitin Omega","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega — ZFC Recursion4 Chaitin Omega","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega — ZFC Recursion4 Chaitin Omega","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega — ZFC Recursion4 Chaitin Omega"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"743918416d7084a1\" href=\"?note=743918416d7084a1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine\">58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99f12f1125ed236a\" href=\"?note=99f12f1125ed236a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,\\Omega_U,M,p,q,c\\in V\">\\(U,\\Omega_U,M,p,q,c\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S\\)</span> (prefix-free-machine predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"743918416d7084a1\" href=\"?note=743918416d7084a1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine\">58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ChaitinOmega}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ChaitinOmega}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}chaitin\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ChaitinOmega}_S(U,\\Omega_U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\forall M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\to\\exists c\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\;\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(q)=M(p)\\land|q|\\leq|p|+c)\\Bigr)\\land\\Omega_U\\in[0,1]\\land\\Omega_U=\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)}2^{-|p|}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}chaitin\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ChaitinOmega}_S(U,\\Omega_U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\forall M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\to\\exists c\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\;\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(q)=M(p)\\land|q|\\leq|p|+c)\\Bigr)\\land\\Omega_U\\in[0,1]\\land\\Omega_U=\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)}2^{-|p|}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is optimal among prefix-free machines up to a machine-dependent additive program-length constant, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> is its halting probability.</li>\n<li>The former unsourced universality predicate is fully expanded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine","status":"resolved","id":"743918416d7084a1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"99f12f1125ed236a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine","status":"resolved","id":"743918416d7084a1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S$ (prefix-free-machine predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"U,\\Omega_U,M,p,q,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ChaitinOmega}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}chaitin\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ChaitinOmega}_S(U,\\Omega_U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\forall M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\to\\exists c\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\;\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(q)=M(p)\\land|q|\\leq|p|+c)\\Bigr)\\land\\Omega_U\\in[0,1]\\land\\Omega_U=\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)}2^{-|p|}","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U","display":false}],"bytes":1412,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega.md|58-df-zfc-recursion4-chaitin-omega]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","743918416d7084a1","99f12f1125ed236a"]}